#: ../../source/docs/common-CUAV-7-Nano.rst:7 e9557488175042f2af465af37d39ece6
msgid ""
"The CUAV-7-Nano flight controller produced by `CUAV "
"<https://www.cuav.net>`_. It has an ultra-small size and a 100M Ethernet "
"interface. Supports 3.3V/5V PWM output."
msgstr ""
"CUAV-7-Nano 飞控由 `CUAV <https://www.cuav.net>`_ 生产。其尺寸超小，配备 100M 以太网接口，支持 "
"3.3V/5V PWM 输出。"

