#: ../../source/docs/common-CUAV-7-Nano.rst:56
#: e658e9554a7a4a50a0e69d5a0eefaed7
msgid "RC Input"
msgstr "RC 输入"

#: ../../source/docs/common-CUAV-7-Nano.rst:58
#: e57ea45d053e47dd8ee50ae4048348cb
msgid ""
"RC input is configured on the RCIN pin, at one end of the servo rail, marked"
" RCIN in the above diagram. All ArduPilot supported unidirectional RC "
"protocols can be input here including PPM. For bi-directional or half-duplex"
" protocols, such as CRSF/ELRS a full UART will have to be used. For example "
"if SERIAL2 (UART5) is used for bi-directional RC, then:"
msgstr ""
"RC 输入配置在舵机轨一端的 RCIN 引脚上（如上图标注）。所有 ArduPilot 支持的单向 RC 协议（包括 "
"PPM）均可在此输入。对于双向或半双工协议（如 CRSF/ELRS），需使用完整的 UART。例如若使用 SERIAL2（UART5）作为双向 "
"RC，则需："

#: ../../source/docs/common-CUAV-7-Nano.rst:60
#: 8c566450ee044f33a9c2443df174b9e1
msgid ":ref:`SERIAL2_PROTOCOL<SERIAL2_PROTOCOL>` must be set to \"23\", and:"
msgstr ":ref:`SERIAL2_PROTOCOL<SERIAL2_PROTOCOL>` 必须设为 「23」，并且："

#: ../../source/docs/common-CUAV-7-Nano.rst:62
#: 6950990452244e42bf7dcb2fb46d17d5
msgid "PPM is not supported."
msgstr "不支持 PPM。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-CUAV-7-Nano.rst:64
#: abcbec34c42849c0b22ec9cd37fec26c
msgid "SBUS/DSM/SRXL connects to the R6 pin."
msgstr "SBUS/DSM/SRXL 连接至 R6 引脚。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-CUAV-7-Nano.rst:66
#: fd0532c8468945c1816cb7f1a3cffd32
msgid ""
"FPort requires connection to Tx and :ref:`SERIAL2_OPTIONS<SERIAL2_OPTIONS>` "
"be set to \"7\"."
msgstr "FPort 需要连接到 Tx，并将 :ref:`SERIAL2_OPTIONS<SERIAL2_OPTIONS>` 设为 「7」。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-CUAV-7-Nano.rst:68
#: 13bf013bbbdc4de0adb53c0a1ec9f942
msgid ""
"CRSF/ELRS also requires a Tx connection, in addition to Rx, and "
"automatically provides telemetry. Set "
":ref:`SERIAL2_OPTIONS<SERIAL2_OPTIONS>` to \"0\"."
msgstr ""
"CRSF/ELRS 除需连接 Rx 外，还需要 Tx 连接，并自动提供数传。将 "
":ref:`SERIAL2_OPTIONS<SERIAL2_OPTIONS>` 设为 「0」。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-CUAV-7-Nano.rst:70
#: 5a981173f4b3483ca3c4cda503505547
msgid ""
"SRXL2 requires a connection to Tx and automatically provides telemetry.  Set"
" :ref:`SERIAL2_OPTIONS<SERIAL2_OPTIONS>` to \"4\"."
msgstr ""
"SRXL2 需要连接到 Tx，并自动提供数传。将 :ref:`SERIAL2_OPTIONS<SERIAL2_OPTIONS>` 设为 「4」。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-CUAV-7-Nano.rst:72
#: 08fa710e196d453a89a49f41cea1ccb3
msgid ""
"Any UART can be used for RC system connections in ArduPilot also, and is "
"compatible with all protocols except PPM. See :ref:`common-rc-systems` for "
"details."
msgstr ""
"在 ArduPilot 中，任何 UART 都可用于 RC 系统连接，并兼容除 PPM 外的所有协议。详情请参阅 :ref:`common-rc-"
"systems`。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-CUAV-7-Nano.rst:75
#: b350597d2ee44bcbb72b0b5c6ace26db
msgid "PWM Output"
msgstr "PWM 输出"

#: ../../source/docs/common-CUAV-7-Nano.rst:77
#: 66a2f76347f041de873503c2ae28f1d2
msgid "The CUAV-7-Nano flight controller supports up to 14 PWM outputs."
msgstr "CUAV-7-Nano 飞控最多支持 14 路 PWM 输出。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-CUAV-7-Nano.rst:79
#: d0ba05a6f6fe47729de541fa96f0f807
msgid "The 14 PWM outputs are in 6 groups:"
msgstr "14 路 PWM 输出分为 6 组："

#: ../../source/docs/common-CUAV-7-Nano.rst:82
#: c33c637511714fbf9282527328bfe49a
msgid "PWM 1-4 in group1 (TIM5)"
msgstr "PWM 1-4 属于第 1 组（TIM5）"

#: ../../source/docs/common-CUAV-7-Nano.rst:83
#: 3b723e775e054791b830790caf2f3bc0
msgid "PWM 5 and 6 in group2 (TIM4)"
msgstr "PWM 5、6 属于第 2 组（TIM4）"

#: ../../source/docs/common-CUAV-7-Nano.rst:84
#: 88f968f9cc5f444c8a7a9aa83fcdc26d
msgid "PWM 7 and 8 in group3 (TIM1)"
msgstr "PWM 7、8 属于第 3 组（TIM1）"

#: ../../source/docs/common-CUAV-7-Nano.rst:85
#: cc6308f5de334172898abea3bfc274dc
msgid "PWM 9, 10 and 11 in group4 (TIM8)"
msgstr "PWM 9、10、11 属于第 4 组（TIM8）"

#: ../../source/docs/common-CUAV-7-Nano.rst:86
#: 7c4161458b06418aabc49798796b5dc4
msgid "PWM 12 in group5 (TIM15)"
msgstr "PWM 12 属于第 5 组（TIM15）"

#: ../../source/docs/common-CUAV-7-Nano.rst:87
#: a0d937970cb34370aede1161e70b2a45
msgid "PWM 13 and 14 in group6 (TIM12)"
msgstr "PWM 13、14 属于第 6 组（TIM12）"

#: ../../source/docs/common-CUAV-7-Nano.rst:89
#: 055529499895453e96b1d36a964abc53
msgid ""
"Channels within the same group need to use the same output rate. If any "
"channel in a group uses DShot then all channels in the group need to use "
"DShot. Outputs 1-4 support BDShot."
msgstr ""
"同一组内的通道必须使用相同的输出频率。若某组中任一通道使用 DShot，则该组所有通道均须使用 DShot。输出 1-4 支持 BDShot。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-CUAV-7-Nano.rst:91
#: 2dfe6584fba4405ba5bda0f7ca2d18f9
msgid ""
"First first 8 PWM outputs of CUAV-7-Nano flight controller support switching"
" between 3.3V voltage and 5V voltage output. It can be switched to 5V by "
"setting GPIO 80 high by setting up a Relay (see :ref:`common-relay`) to "
"control it."
msgstr ""
"CUAV-7-Nano 飞控前 8 路 PWM 输出支持在 3.3V 和 5V 输出电压之间切换。可通过设置继电器（参阅 :ref:`common-"
"relay`）将 GPIO 80 置高切换至 5V。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-CUAV-7-Nano.rst:94
#: c8381c27b6ff4040ba6fa76b1635c29e
msgid "Battery Monitoring"
msgstr "电池监测"

#: ../../source/docs/common-CUAV-7-Nano.rst:96
#: 3d48f091d26e4b10b8e411c773b7862a
msgid ""
"The board has a dedicated power monitor ports on 6 pin connectors(POWER A). "
"The correct battery setting parameters are dependent on the type of power "
"brick which is connected. Parameters for the supplied powe monitor are "
"already set by default. However, if lost or changed:"
msgstr ""
"该飞控板在 6 针接头（POWER "
"A）上有专用电源监测接口。正确的电池参数设置取决于所连接的电源模块类型。随机附带的电源监测模块的参数已默认设置。若参数丢失或被修改："

#: ../../source/docs/common-CUAV-7-Nano.rst:99
#: 979dd7350ce24ceda2d1a22cd397766e
msgid "Enable Battery monitor with these parameter settings :"
msgstr "使用以下参数设置启用电池监控："

