#: ../../source/docs/common-CUAV-7-Nano.rst:114
#: 984442db09554f0c8a51f3f7b7a67101
msgid ""
"The CUAV-7-Nano has an IST8310 builtin compass, but due to interference the "
"board is usually used with an external I2C compass as part of a GPS/Compass "
"combination."
msgstr "CUAV-7-Nano 内置 IST8310 罗盘，但由于干扰问题，通常搭配外置 I2C 罗盘（作为 GPS/罗盘组合模块的一部分）使用。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-CUAV-7-Nano.rst:117
#: 67af16bf0a1e4552bfda16f0fca163ca
