"Firmware for these boards can be found at https://firmware.ardupilot.org in "
"sub-folders labeled \"CUAV-7-Nano\"."
msgstr "该飞控板的固件可在 https://firmware.ardupilot.org 的「CUAV-7-Nano」子文件夹中找到。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-CUAV-7-Nano.rst:134
